    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4927" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁμαξ-ῐτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ep.
		 and Lyr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμ-, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμαξα, εἶμι</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ibo</i>) <i>traversed by
				wagons,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ. ὁδός</span>”
				<i>carriage-road, high-road, highway,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					6.54
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.2.21
			</span></i>; without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδός,</span> as
				Subst., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.146
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				177
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				599
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.200
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.926
			</span></i> (Epid.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tab.Heracl.</u>
				1.60
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τριπλαῖς ἁ.</span> in a
			place where three <i>ways</i> meet, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				716
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
